00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:56.810
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:58.110
<i>And I'm Jasmine.</i>

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:03.280
<i>We're currently travelling to seven perilous places in order to recover the seven stolen gems!</i>

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:07.290
<i>We've already acquired the topaz, ruby, opal, and the lapis lazuli!</i>

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:10.800
<i>We had to face some monsters, but they weren't anything we couldn't handle!</i>

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:16.800
<i>Hey now, we don't know what kind of enemies we'll have face in the future. You both need to be careful.</i>

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:19.400
<i>Geez, you worry too much, Barda!</i>

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:24.110
<i>And right now, we're headed to Dread Mountain where the fifth gem is located!</i>

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:35.300
Your magic is phenomenal,

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.450
My Shadow Lord.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:44.510
To think that you could even revive me at will...

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:50.700
M-My Shadow Lord...!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.200
What is it, Fallow?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:59.500
I have just received word that the lapis lazuli from the Tower of Death was snatched by those three not too long ago...!

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:19.400
You speak of the three who killed me last time, eh...?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.400
Rae Exalaedus, Imu Dominum Sedolak...

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.040
Thaegan!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:37.100
Sorceress Thaegan... Do not waste this second life that I have granted you.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:40.800
That's right! Search for them and kill them!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.930
I do not take orders from the likes of you.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:50.650
Whether I kill them, eternally torment them, or simply turn them into monsters...

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:53.700
That will be my decision to make.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.600
Why don't you try being useful as well, Fallow?

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.510
C-Certainly! Please leave it to me!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.600
The next gem is in Dread Mountain, huh...

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.880
But with four gems collected already, that leaves only three!

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.600
Try not to keep overdoing it this time, though.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.120
When have I ever been 'overdoing it'?

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:33.500
All the time.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.870
Seems like you can't win against Jasmine, Lief.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:45.700
Lief!

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:59.060
Is it an Ak-Baba?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.500
It doesn't seem to be...

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:07.850
This likely means that the Shadow Lord is already aware that we've taken the lapis lazuli...

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:12.140
And I'm sure that they will only grow more frantic in their search for us now.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.920
Yeah, we need to be on guard.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:28.800
<i>Zan, Zod, Pik, Snik, Lun, Lod and last of all the dreaded Ichabod!</i>

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:33.280
<i>And the names of her children are,</i>

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.450
<i>Hot, Tot, Jin!</i>

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.150
<i>Jod, Fie, Fly!</i>

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:44.790
Zan, Zod, Pik, Snik, Lun, Lod and last of all the dreaded Ichabod!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.950
Have you been well, my children?

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:08.620
Hot, Tot, Pik, Snik, Zan and Zod,

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:14.330
Fie, Fly, Lun, Lod, Ichabod,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.710
And, Jin and Jod?

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:22.030
Mama! Mama! Mama! Mama! Mama! Mama! Mama! Mama! Mama!!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.810
That's enough! Be silent!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:34.040
Don't worry, Jin, Jod, this time I will definitely punish those three who made you this way, okay?

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:36.390
You mean those guys who we weren't able-

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.710
To eat last time, right?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.500
We'll definitely eat them this time!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.500
You four.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.320
Bring those three to me.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.100
Make sure you don't eat them on the way, you hear me?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.620
O-Okay...

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.520
Understood, Mama...

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:54.700
Rae Ex,

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:55.600
Thaegan!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.410
It's a rainbow!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.000
But what an unpleasant place this is...

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.810
Can't we find some way around it?

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:26.700
Even the trees here are afraid of that place...

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.890
Are you alright?

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:38.680
Thank you for your kindness...

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:43.610
It's nothing...

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.620
Are you travelling alone?

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:56.250
Yes... I was on my way to my mother's place, actually.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.550
Your mother's?

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.900
Yes!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:03.200
She lives just beyond Rainbow Cave; it's down that way.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.760
Down in <i>that</i>  place?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:10.810
Yes. It's a little scary- looking, so people usually steer clear of it...

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:14.480
But, as a result, it means that it's quite a safe place to live, you see?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.970
I see... That may very well be true.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.460
I actually live in another village, but...

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.340
My mother has fallen ill, so I was on my way to visit her.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:25.850
Is that right...

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.490
I see... That must be hard on you...

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:31.240
Say, where are you three headed?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.000
Ah, the mountain up ahead.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.090
You mean Dread Mountain? Then do you mind if we go together?

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.900
Huh? Together...?

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.680
Yes, may I join you on the way?

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.780
It's quicker if you go through the Rainbow Cave, after all.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:49.480
As well as that, it really is lonely to travel alone...

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.040
The Rainbow Cave, huh...

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.670
It's a shortcut, so let's go with her!

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.330
I won't step foot into that place.

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.730
But we're going in the same direction anyway!

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.800
Kree also doesn't want to.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:10.030
We're going to lose our lives before we've collected the gems if you keep plunging head-first into danger, you know?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:14.400
But, it may also be the safest route to the mountain.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:19.110
He's right! Besides, we may as well walk that girl to her mother's place too!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.930
I see that both of you have this weakness, then...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.390
What do you mean?

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.300
I'm talking about your weakness to cute girls!

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:40.020
Aren't they pretty? I was thinking of picking some for my mother,

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.530
But doing that would just make me feel bad for them.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:45.300
We'll go together with you to your mother's place.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.600
I'm Lief.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.750
They're Barda and Jasmine. And you are...?

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.600
M-My name is Fran-...

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.600
Françoise!

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:00.510
Nice to meet you, Lief!

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:05.560
Nice to meet you, too.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:17.700
He hasn't listened to a word I've said...

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:29.940
Lief!!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.560
That girl's bag is...!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.960
My bag...?

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:41.270
It suddenly grew sharp teeth and was about to bite you, Lief!

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:43.780
Geez!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:46.700
Jasmine!

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.850
It's just a normal bag, isn't it?

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:53.900
But I clearly saw it!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.650
It's the Mirage Plant's fruit that's common around here.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:04.060
It can make you see illusions just by touching it.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.230
Illusions?

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.720
A Mirage Plant, you said?

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:10.090
I've never heard of such a plant.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:11.250
Yes.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.200
It only grows in this area; please take care.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:16.600
Thanks.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.000
It sure helps to have a local with us.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.000
Agreed.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.530
I won't be so easily fooled...

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:40.190
Barda, look out!!

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:41.780
Ouch!

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:44.970
Aren't <i>you</i>  the danger here, Jasmine?!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:49.290
But this time, it was this hat of hers that was about to chomp on Barda's head!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:52.790
Are you alright, Miss Jasmine...?

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:58.200
I'm really sorry about her. She usually doesn't act like this...

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:01.520
Perhaps it's the effect of that Mirage Plant after all.

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:05.920
I've seriously never heard of such a plant before, though...

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.000
Don't worry.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:11.600
It doesn't do any harm to your body, so you should be back to normal in no time!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.720
What was that just now?!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.340
No...! Please stop that!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.640
Cut it out, Jasmine!!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:25.790
But her tail was just-

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.770
Shall we take a break now?

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:32.400
Perhaps Miss Jasmine will calm down that way...

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:33.980
You might be right.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:39.500
Then I'm going to get some water, okay? There's a spring not too far from here.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.320
I'm surprised she didn't get angry after all that...

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.800
She sure is kind.

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.170
What the hell were you two doing?!

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:02.500
How can we stop ourselves with such delicious food right in front of us?!

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:06.540
Besides, you made a blunder as well!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.370
Are you okay now, Jasmine?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.250
I'm fine...

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:36.870
Seems like that plant's poison has finally worn off, then...

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.870
Like I said, there was nothing wrong with me from the start...

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:44.590
Your tail was in plain sight!

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.590
It's fine, no one realised it!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.700
I really want to eat them!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:53.180
You have to endure it! We promised to bring those three to Mama, right?

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:57.870
We're just going to kill them after this, right? So a bite or two shouldn't make a difference!

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.760
Geez, I really want to eat them!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:02.000
Do you plan to go against Mama?!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.090
I just want to take a bite or two!

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:04.900
Shut up!

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:06.800
What the hell was that for?!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.120
Ow ow ow, that hurts!!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.450
How dare you!

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.290
Françoise?

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.500
Françoi-

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.620
What is it, Lief?

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.490
O-On your head...

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:40.170
I was just curious as to whether my bag would feel lighter if I put it on my head...

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.500
A-Ah, I'm sorry.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.800
I didn't realise; I can carry it for you.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.790
Anyway, let's get moving.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:48.340
Okay.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.220
Geez, that's so embarrassing...

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.180
I couldn't care less what happens to them anymore!

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.580
Oh dear, could you please stop talking about that?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.920
So, that's why I offered to carry it for her.

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:05.340
Thank you again for that.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.480
By the way, Françoise...

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.600
W-What...?

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.980
What kind of person is your mother?

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.900
She's really pretty and strong...

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.340
And she's so amazing that everyone fears her!

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:21.050
F-Fears...?

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:27.120
And she's really strict. But it seems like my grandmother was stricter, so my mother had a hard time training.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:28.000
Training?

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:32.810
Y-Yes! But thanks to that, my mother turned out for the better.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:35.590
So what does she do, then?

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.000
Sorcer-...

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.150
I-I mean, m-magic!

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:43.230
That's an interesting job she has, there.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:45.070
But it sure sounds fun.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.890
Do you have any other family members?

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:48.430
I have a lot of siblings!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:49.800
How nice...

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.910
It may sound nicer than it is...

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:56.050
We're always fighting, and it only got worse when our mother died...

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:56.960
Died?!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:01.610
What I meant to say was that she almost died once in the past!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:05.530
I see... Your mother is quite a sickly person, isn't she?

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:11.520
Yes... But she ate a lot of crows recently, so she's doing well now.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:12.520
Crows?!

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:21.420
No... I meant cro- croquettes! She really likes them!

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.800
You know, that almost made me remember something...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.150
Just what was it...?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.330
Ow!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.390
I'm so sorry!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:38.290
It seems like I forgot to close my bag properly, and it even injured you...

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.760
I wonder if the zipper is already broken...

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:48.510
A-Are you alright?!

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:54.000
Y-Yes... I'm so sorry for raising my voice all of a sudden... This is so embarrasing...

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.770
I also heard other voices, though.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:00.600
My, Miss Jasmine... Have your ears started playing tricks on you now?

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.880
I doubt we could retrieve them from here...

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.200
It's okay. There was nothing of value in them anyway.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:09.320
That's quite unlucky.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:14.220
On the contrary! I think I'm very lucky considering I was able to meet you guys on my travels!

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.920
She must be trying not to worry us.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.400
Yeah, you're right; she is kind.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:25.920
<i>She's so suspicious, no matter how you look at her! Why aren't these two realising it?!</i>

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:32.020
Damn Fie and Fly... This is unforgivable...!

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.230
How dare they keep the food for themselves!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.880
Now we just have to pass through this cave and we'll reach my mother's house.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:44.590
Alright, let's go!

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:46.100
Wait!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.000
What's wrong?

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:49.650
Something's in there.

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:02.680
Oh, they're just bats.

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:31.040
Grey Guards!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.150
Looks like we have no choice but to fight.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.410
Get back, Françoise!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:42.830
B-But...!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:19:01.700
Getting in my way when we're almost there... All of our work would be for nothing if they died here!

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.630
